Maria Lopez: Hey Isabella! How's all the Valentine's Day prep going? It looks like you're super busy!
Isabella Rodriguez: It's a flurry of activity, but it's so exciting! We're putting together something special for our customers on the 14th. How about you, how are your physics studies going this week?
Maria Lopez: They're keeping me busy, as always! I've been spending a lot of time here at Hobbs Cafe reviewing some concepts, which is perfect since I can still get some caffeine in. Are you getting ready for a big crowd on the 14th?
Isabella Rodriguez: Oh, a big crowd, yes! I'm so looking forward to it. I've been working on a few special touches to make sure everyone feels warm and welcome, just how I like it. It's going to be a lovely evening. Speaking of which, you mentioned reviewing concepts—is there any particular topic in physics that's challenging you lately?
